# DJ01: MIDI CC 106 (LFO 1 WAVE) on the auto channel (10, status b9: the active track, track 1) with the values
# 0, 3, 6, 7, 8, 9, 12, 15, 16, 40, 127 and back to 1, a screen after each (MOD page, LFO 1). The CC value is the
# parameter value (ParameterSet::vslot27: v << 8), clamped to the row's range: stock 0..6, DJ01 0..15.
wait-emu 0.5
tap semicolon        # MOD: LFO 1
wait-emu 0.5
png 00-lfo1
midi-in b9 6a 00
wait-emu 0.4
png cc000
midi-in b9 6a 03
wait-emu 0.4
png cc003
midi-in b9 6a 06
wait-emu 0.4
png cc006
midi-in b9 6a 07
wait-emu 0.4
png cc007
midi-in b9 6a 08
wait-emu 0.4
png cc008
midi-in b9 6a 09
wait-emu 0.4
png cc009
midi-in b9 6a 0c
wait-emu 0.4
png cc012
midi-in b9 6a 0f
wait-emu 0.4
png cc015
midi-in b9 6a 10
wait-emu 0.4
png cc016
midi-in b9 6a 28
wait-emu 0.4
png cc040
midi-in b9 6a 7f
wait-emu 0.4
png cc127
midi-in b9 6a 01
wait-emu 0.4
png cc001
